    "multiple_text_with_image_QEWhpQ": {
      "type": "multiple-text-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "item_waUGjV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-1.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Tennis necklaces",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Diamond tennis necklaces are some of the most versatile pieces you can have in your jewelry box.</p><p>Not only can you wear them with any style of clothing on any occasion, but they can also be mixed and matched with every jewelry piece in your collection. Not to mention, <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Tennis Necklaces</a> are also among the most elegant and sophisticated jewelry pieces there are.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_mBLEXd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-2.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Station necklaces",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p><a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Station Necklaces</a> are just as versatile as plain chain necklaces, but their unexpected design makes them a step-up in the style department - especially when you layer them with a couple of other necklaces.</p><p>Designs range from diamond station necklaces to styles featuring gold beads, pearls, and colorful gemstones. Diamond station necklaces are particularly great accessories because they add an understated touch of elegance to your outfits.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_gHGYtV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-3.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Bar necklaces",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>As the name suggests, these necklaces feature a precious metal bar attached to the chain - but there’s much more to these necklaces than that!</p><p>Designs can vary from plain horizontal bars to diamond-encrusted curved bars and even double-bar necklaces, so you have a huge amount of options to choose from. <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Bar Necklaces</a> are an easy way to dress up everything from a plain t-shirt to a cocktail dress.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_NWaejb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-4.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Diamond necklaces",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>From dainty diamond pendants to lavish tennis necklaces, these pieces are the perfect way to make any outfit look super chic and stylish. You can wear diamond necklaces day and night to add that elegant glow to your every outfit.</p><p>The best part is that <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Diamond Necklaces</a> are no longer reserved for special occasions - they’ve become such a staple that they can be easily incorporated into everyday outfits, no matter how understated they are.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_wGFdXT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-5.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Gold necklaces",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Not only do <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Gold Necklaces</a> ooze luxury and sophistication, but they also make any outfit look infinitely more stylish in seconds.</p><p>The greatest thing about gold necklaces is that designs range from delicate and minimalist to ornate and oversized, making your options endless. If you’re all about understated elegance, invest in a delicate gold chain. But, if you love statement jewelry, then layer gold necklaces of different styles and lengths for a super trendy look.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_pRCdU3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace-style-6.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Chain necklace",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Arguably one of the most popular and timeless necklace designs, <a href=\"/pages/necklaces-and-pendants-guide\" title=\"Necklaces and Pendants Guide\">Chain Necklaces</a> are must-haves in any collection. The greatest thing about chains is that you can either wear your necklace by itself or personalize it with a pendant.</p><p>And, the best part about them is that you can opt for designs that carry special meaning, such as initial pendants and medallions. That’s a great way for you to make jewelry even more personal and always carry special keepsakes close to your heart.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        }
      },
