    "multiple_text_with_image_rAd8Gk": {
      "type": "multiple-text-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "item_JCQWFV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pendant-1.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Religious pendants",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p><a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Religious Pendants</a>, such as crosses and medals, are a great way for you to incorporate your faith into your everyday life. As a symbol of protection and devotion, religious necklaces are more than mere accessories - they carry great meaning.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_FX6bBN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pendant-2.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Meaningful designs",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>If you’re not a particular religious or spiritual person, you can still incorporate meaningful pieces into your jewelry collection by opting for designs that carry some sort of significance, such as <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Heart Pendants</a>, <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Initials</a>, pendants that outline your home state, and even <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Journey Necklaces</a>. No matter which design you choose, you can be sure you’ll be wearing your special pendant for years to come.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_MAdfp8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pendant-3.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Diamond pendants",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>If you’re after an eye-catching design that you can wear with everything, then diamond pendants are just what you need in your collection. Whether you prefer <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Halos</a>, <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Solitaires</a>, or <a href=\"/collections/necklaces\" title=\"Necklaces\">Three-stone diamond pendants</a>, you can easily find the perfect design for you to style with every piece in your closet and pair with any accessory in your jewelry collection.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        }
      },
